Subject: [PATCH] ioRTCW-PS3 1.1: crosshair picker and character shadows in the
 menus

From issue #1 (cyper-PL):

- The options menus' crosshair picker (ownerdraw UI_CROSSHAIR) is now
  reachable with the pad; its key handler reports the key as used, so
  left / right change the crosshair instead of also moving the focus.
- "Texture Compression" (meaningless on PS3) becomes "Character Shadows",
  the cg_shadows switch (0 off, 1 blob shadows).

Patch 21.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SYMuiVSd8MmTqxYvUSCv5
